                                        "sense_id": "4462b29e-e1ac-3523-9d86-17e51dfd2a52",
                                        "entry_id": "58ab8fe5-816a-3f47-8d6e-862503a91885",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The systematic or targeted killing of animals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25c4230f-b485-48db-ac70-ef2702b8d25a",
                                                "sense_id": "4462b29e-e1ac-3523-9d86-17e51dfd2a52",
                                                "text": "Much later, however, during the Permian period, there was a second act of zoocide, one which is less known and less popular among filmmakers ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18c07034-67a7-4411-98ca-b7f123ceca02",
                                                "sense_id": "4462b29e-e1ac-3523-9d86-17e51dfd2a52",
                                                "text": "When the bounty system alone failed to kill all the wolves, the federal government underwrote a kind of zoocide using bounties, trapping, hunting, ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff019ed0-e2f4-423a-a5b9-b556650aba3d",
                                                "sense_id": "4462b29e-e1ac-3523-9d86-17e51dfd2a52",
                                                "text": "Our proposal is that we speak of zoocide in cases where animals are systematically put to death in large numbers. Zoocide cannot be placed on the same level ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea79f59d-bf8d-35b7-b943-74d864052d2f",
                                        "entry_id": "58ab8fe5-816a-3f47-8d6e-862503a91885",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any substance intended to kill animals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
